                                "example_id": "05feb147-018f-4012-b85e-b25ed9a75836",
                                "sense_id": "a48c5168-8dc1-3fa8-a097-eadc493f107f",
                                "text": "[…] the air [was] sweet with the sap adrip from the orchards lately pruned […]"
