                                "sense_id": "14a692e8-3c37-3185-8c23-024d02f25e0e",
                                "text": "And she with Goban’s wine adrip,\nNo more remembering what had been,\nStared at the gods with laughing lip."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6132bb5-e60a-4545-b9af-eb39458d4c30",
                                "sense_id": "14a692e8-3c37-3185-8c23-024d02f25e0e",
                                "text": "He was naked to the waist, his hairy breast and arms to the armpits clotted and adrip with blood, and in his hands two bloody daggers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "886279af-9943-461f-be27-0a9cfa00ef20",
                                "sense_id": "14a692e8-3c37-3185-8c23-024d02f25e0e",
                                "text": "Melting snow gurgled in drainspouts and gutters, all Copenhagen was adrip."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
